    "body": "## Scope\nImplements Chat05B only on `main@00ce2baca8dca177dfadffcb8bccbae11bca118f`.\n\n- Persists server-created social vote deadlines and explicit quorum/duration policy.\n- Enforces the strict human ballot boundary in the D1 write trigger using a Worker-authored trusted timestamp captured immediately before SQL dispatch: `trusted_now_ms < deadline_at_ms`; equality and later are rejected.\n- Preserves Chat05A vote and human ballot tables. Adds a constrained deadline sidecar plus a separate deterministic NPC fixture ballot table.\n- Closes via one D1 `batch()` with NPC fill and terminal state update; retry/restart reads the durable result. NPC fixture choices are deterministic, and the quorum is configured rather than fixed as game balance.\n- Includes request-path recovery if the scheduler was missed.\n\n## Validation\n- Python SQLite migration/Chat05A regression suite: 12/12 passed.\n- Full local Wrangler/workerd/D1 private API run passed, including migration 0011 over a populated legacy human ballot, D-1 / D / D+1 checks (including delayed dispatch), 0/1/4/6/7 matrix with test quorum 7, quorum cap, concurrent close and last-human race, rollback/retry, repeated timeout, and open-ballot Worker restart plus missed-scheduler recovery.\n- The 7-vote quorum and 60-second duration are local test-wrapper settings only, not approved balance values.\n- CI runs are pending for this PR head.\n\nNo Cloudflare deployment or remote D1 migration was run. No Chat05C, Chat06, UI, economy, REP, or event-log work is included. This Draft remains unmerged and does not assert hosted/runtime acceptance.",
